==Rules==
{{ColosseumRule|Half-Off: S. Rare}}

==Battleground==
*20 [[Zackie Peng]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 33.33~40 seconds<sup>1,000f~1,200f</sup>.
*5 [[Zoge]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 20~26.67 seconds<sup>600f~800f</sup>.
*1 [[Owlbrow]] spawns after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>.
*1 [[Zollow]] spawns after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Queen B]] spawns as the boss.
**1 [[Zapy]] spawns.
**1 [[Mini White Cyclone]] spawns after 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>.
**5 [[Zollow]]s spawn after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>, delay 10~13.33 seconds<sup>300f~400f</sup>.
**1 [[Mini White Cyclone]] spawns after 76.67 seconds<sup>2,300f</sup>.
**3 [[Zollow]]s spawn after 80 seconds<sup>2,400f</sup>, delay 3.33~10 seconds<sup>100f~300f</sup>.
**1 [[Zapy]] spawns after 83.33 seconds<sup>2,500f</sup>.
**7 [[Zollow]]s spawn after 113.33 seconds<sup>3,400f</sup>, delay 10~16.67 seconds<sup>300f~500f</sup>.

==Strategy==
An easy stage to rush. Send in [[Slime Cat (Rare Cat)|Jelly Dumpling Cat]] alone to knock Zackie Peng out of his burrow animation, then wait for Zollow to spawn and kill it with [[Express Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Bullet Train Cat]]. If Zackie Peng isn't dead yet, finish him off with another Jelly Dumpling Cat, then immediately start swarming the Owlbrow with [[Hip Hop Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Can Can Cats]], [[Swimmer Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Fishman Cats]], and [[Crazed Cow Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Manic Lion Cats]].

As soon as he's dead, summon [[Talents|Talented]] [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Awakened Bahamut Cat]] to hopefully hit the enemy base and start wailing on the boss and her supports. [[Brainwashed Lion Cat]], [[Courier Cat]], and [[Brainwashed Island Cat]] can be used to stack up additional rushing power and to defend against Zapy in the case of the latter. Ideally, Queen B will die insanely quickly and Zapy won't be able to hit Bahamut through the wall of Super Rare attackers, eventually finishing the stage in record time.

